  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EaP SMECI - ACBA Leasing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The provision of a senior unsecured loan to ACBA Leasing in the amount of up to  USD 5m for on-lending to micro, small and medium-sized enterprises (&quot;MSMEs&quot;) in  Armenia under the Eastern Partnership SME Competitiveness and Inclusion (&quot;EaP  SMECI&quot;) Programme.  The Loan will support sustainable investments and promotion of green  technologies among local MSMEs that will assist in improving competitiveness  and compliance with technical and environmental standards in line with the EU  directives. Up to 70% of the sub-loans are expected to be green/GET-eligible.</narrative>
  </description>
